% EXOT-2015-01 fig_01: q qbar > mu* mu via contact interaction (blob), mu* > mu q qbar via contact interaction (blob)
layout: v2
in: i1 i2
out: mu1 mu2 q2 qb2
i1 [q] -- [fermion] a [blob]
a -- [fermion] i2 [qbar]
a -- [fermion] mu1 [mu-]
b [blob] -- [fermion, label=\mu^{*+}] a
mu2 [mu+] -- [fermion] b
b -- [fermion] q2 [q]
qb2 [qbar] -- [fermion] b
